From be6d90733d6e89cc2a21645cbdfa6f1f8c2b6d10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 16:39:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: modernize UI/UX with premium SaaS design system
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Complete visual redesign across all core components preserving all existing
functionality, routing, state management, and API integrations. Introduces a
cohesive design system with glass morphism topbars, refined typography hierarchy,
consistent card/shadow patterns, polished interaction states, and responsive
layouts aligned to the IntelliMeet brand.

- index.css: custom shadow scale, nav-item-active glow, badge/stat-card utilities,
  shimmer/fade-in/scale-in/pulse-dot animations, glass and topbar-glass classes
- Sidebar: dark gradient panel (264px), noise texture, AI badge, enterprise card,
  animated profile dropdown with chevron rotation
- SearchBar: focus-ring with green glow, ⌘K shortcut badge
- RecentMeetingsTable: stat cards, gradient avatars, scale-in dropdown, live sync dot
- RightSidebar: compact calendar, pulse-dot connection status, gradient upcoming card
- Dashboard: sidebar offset corrected to 264px
- Meetings: topbar-glass, gradient create button, scale-in dropdown, modal polish
- MeetingDetails: breadcrumb nav, colored section badges, custom checkbox, AI panel
- SignIn: gradient logo, social buttons, dot-grid right panel, feature cards
- Todos: stat cards with colored left-border accents, custom toggle, filter tabs
- AskAI: role-aware bubbles, numbered AI list badges, context attach button
- AppIntegrations: colored icon backgrounds, toggle switch, Active badge, filter tabs
- AccountSettings: two-panel layout, sticky left nav, SSO revoke section

